  "draft_py": "# FDN High-Society Hunter: \"Flying. Whenever this creature attacks, you may sacrifice another\n# creature. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Whenever another nontoken creature\n# dies, draw a card.\"\n# [0]: \"Whenever this creature attacks\" (Library Larcenist's DeclareAttackersEvent over the source);\n# effect: M21 Dire Fleet Warmonger's verified \"you may sacrifice another creature. If you do, ...\"\n# with Lorescale Coatl's counter on this creature.\n# [1]: a CreatureDiesEvent over any player's nontoken creature but this one (FNot(IS_TOKEN),\n# FNot(IS_SOURCE)); \"draw a card\" (Crash Through).\nattacks = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=DeclareAttackersEvent(filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            OptionalEffect(\n                inner=A(Verb.SACRIFICE, {\n                    'target': Selector(\n                        count=QConst(value=1),\n                        mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                        filter=FAnd(\n                            children=(\n                                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                                FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n                            ),\n                        ),\n                        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                    ),\n                }),\n            ),\n            Conditional(\n                pred=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.MAY_DONE),\n                then_effect=A(Verb.PUT_COUNTER, {\n                    'count': QConst(value=1),\n                    'counter_kind': CounterKind.PLUS_1_PLUS_1,\n                    'target': Selector(\n                        count=QConst(value=1),\n                        mode=SelectorMode.CHOOSE,\n                        filter=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE),\n                        zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n                    ),\n                }),\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\ndies = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=CreatureDiesEvent(\n        filter=FAnd(\n            children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_SOURCE)),\n                FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_TOKEN)),\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=A(Verb.DRAW, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n)\nabilities = [attacks, dies, *compiled]\n",
